Description:
Illustration to Cadell & Davies' edition of Defoe's book 'Robinson Crusoe', vol. I, page 93; after Stothard.
Robinson Crusoe at work in his cave: Crusoe sitting in a cave, whittling a stick, surrounded by implements, with a dog in the left foreground, and two cats next to Crusoe. 1820
Etching and engraving on chine collé;

