Description:
Part 3, plate 6 from a series of pattern or copybook sheets: an arrangement of mammals of disproportionate size, with a large domestic cat in the centre, a mouse above the cat, a shaggy dog in the upper right,  a cow in the upper left, a dead mouse at lower right, a large rat with half a walnut at right centre, a fox at left centre, and a monkey at lower left, among other small animals. 
Engraving
Large portion of sheet missing at bottom, affecting the image.;

